ummary><div class="border-t border-gray-100 px-5 py-4 dark:border-gray-700"><p class="font-inter text-sm leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-brand-slate-gray/80 dark:text-gray-300">Yes, all talks are recorded and published on our YouTube channel
